    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ū Isilaeli ng'wene ngomi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu lūshikū lwikūmi ng'weji gwa katanò, ng'waka gwa mpungatī, bamò ba banamhala ba Isilaeli bakiza kūbūūja kūlī SEEBA; būshika bigasha kū būtongi bone. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mhayo go ng'wa SEEBA gūnizīīla: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'wana wa munhū, lūngalūngaga nabo a banamhala ba Isilaeli ūbawīle, “Ū Seeba MULUNGU alīhaya gīkī, ‘Ng'wizaga kūbūūja kūlī nene? Alīyo ūmo nene nalī mpanga, natūmuzunīlīja kūnibūūja mhayo;’ alīhaya Seeba MULUNGU.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alihooyaga nabo! Ng'wana wa munhū ūdūgije ū kūhooya nabo? Bizūkījage ī shītīle sha basaabo ī sh'ipelanya; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ūbawīle gīkī, “Ū Seeba MULUNGU alīhaya, Ū mu lūshikū nansolelaga ū Isilaeli, nakawilahīlīla ū būbyīle wa numba ya ng'wa Yakobo; niyoolecha ū kūbo balī mu Misili. Nūgoloola nkono gwane nūbawīla, ‘Ū nene nalī SEEBA Mulungu wing'we.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mu lūshikū lwenūlo nakabilahīlīla gīkī nakūbīnja ū mu sī ya Misili nabatwale kū sī īyo naalī nīkooba kūlwa nguno yabo; sī ya būhondo, sī yawiza kūtinda jose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nakabawīla, ‘Būlī ūmò wing'we n'agaponyage a mashigīmbo gakwe ga malofu ayo agakalalīlile, yaya ū kwikala ng'wisosohaja na shiikolile sha kūlamiwa sha Misili; ū nene nalī SEEBA Mulungu wing'we.’”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo bakanigomela, būlema ū kūniigwa; batagaponije a mashigīmbo gabo ga malofu ayo baalī bagakalalīlile, nūūlū a shiikolile sha kūlamiwa sha Misili batashilekile. Hū nūhaya kūbitīīla būpelanu bone, nabūmalīle kūbo ū būdaki bone aho balī mu Misili. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwike kūlwa nguno ya lina lyane, nūbeeja gwa kūlīlang'hana lītizūsosohala mu būtongi wa banhū ba mahanga abo bikalaga mubo, abo mu būtongi wabo naalī niyoolecha ū kū Baisilaeli kūlwa kūbafunya ū mu sī ya Misili. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna lūūlū nūbafunya ū mu sī ya Misisli, nūbatongeela kūja kū sī y'itogolo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nūbinha malange gane, nī shilagīlo shane nūbakundūlīla, īsho ūlū munhū ūshidima akūbiza mpanga kūlwaasho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nīyo nī sabato jane nūbinha, jibize būmanīkījo a ha gatī yane na a boi, badeebe gīkī ū nene SEEBA hū nakabīītaga kūbiza beela.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo a banhū ba numba ya Isilaeli būnigomela aho balī ū mu sī y'itogolo, batashimīzīlile ū mu malange gane, nī shilagīlo shane būshilema, īsho ūlū munhū ūshidima akūbiza mpanga kūlwaasho. Ī sabato jane ī jene būjisosohaja kībi no. Hūna nūhaya nabitīīle būpelanu bone, nabamalīle ū mu sī y'itogolo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwike kūlwa nguno ya lina lyane nūbeeja gwa kūlīlang'hana lītizūsosohala mu būtongi wa banhū ba mahanga, abo baalī baabona nalībīnja a Baisilaeli ū mu sī ya Misili. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo nahene nakagoloola nkono gwane nūbilahīlīla aho balī ū ng'witogolo; gīkī natūbingīja ū mu sī īyo naalī nabinha; sī ya būhondo, sī yawiza kūtinda jose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū gwenūyū nakagwīta kūlwa nguno baalī bashilema ī shilagīlo shane, na a malange gane baalī balema ū kūgalondeela; nī sabato jane bajisosohajaga, nguno ī ng'holò jabo jalī jilolile kū shiikolile sha kūlamiwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo nūbachīla shigongo nahene, nūleka ū kūbakenaagūla nūūlū kūbamala gete aho balī kwitogolo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nūbawīla a baana babo ū kwitogolo kwenūko, Yaya a bing'we ū kūlondeela kajīle ka basīng'we, nūūlū ū kūshidima ī shilagīlo shabo, nūūlū kwisosohaja kūlwa shiikolile shabo sha kūlamiwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū nene nalī Seeba Mulungu wing'we, galondeelagi a malange gane, mushidime mu welwa ng'holò ī shilagīlo shane. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nī sabato jane jikūjagi jiikale neela ū kū bing'we, jibize būmanīkījo a ha gatī yane na a bing'we; mudeebe gīkī ū nene hū nalī SEEBA Mulungu wing'we.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo na a baana babo bakanigomela, batagalondeelile a malange gane; nī shilagīlo shane batashidimile mu welwa ng'holò, nūūlū īkī ūlū munhū ūshidima akūbiza mpanga kūlwaasho; pyī nī sabato jane būjisosohaja. Hūna nūhaya nakūbitīīla būpelanu bone, ū būdaki bone nabūmalīle kūbo ū mu sī y'itogolo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwike nūgūlemeja ū nkono gwane, na kūlwa nguno ya lina lyane nūbeeja gwa kūlīlang'hana lītizūsosohala mu būtongi wa banhū ba mahanga, abo baalī babona nalībīnja a Baisilaeli ū mu sī ya Misili. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo nahene nakagoloola nkono gwane nūbilahīlīla aho balī ū ng'witogolo; gīkī nakūbabbalasanya mu mahanga, nabasambaagīje hose pyī ū mu masī, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kūlwa nguno baalī batashiigwaga ī shilagīlo shane, na a malange gane baalī bagalemile, nī sabato jane baajikenaagūlaga, īkī a miso gabo gaalī gaadutwa na shiikolile sha kūlamiwa sha basaabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanuma ya henaho nakabatūūla ha sīlīlī ya malange mabi, na shilagīlo īsho shaalī shitadūgije kūbagunanha kūpandīka būpanga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nīyo nūbalekanīja bandya kwisosohaja mu nzīla ya shakwinha shabo, būyūbafunya shitambò a babyalwa babo ba kwandya; nsango gwa kogohya, badeebe gīkī ū nene hū nalī SEEBA.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.26",
