            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alilūūlū ng'wana wa munhū, bawīlage a Baisilaeli īyo nene Seeba MULUNGU nalībawīla: Gūūyū mhayo gwa koolecha gīkī a bakūlūgenji babo baalī banibengelegije kūlwa kūnileka: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno aho nabashisha ū mu sī īyo naalī nabisagīj kūbinha, bandya kūyūfunya shitambò shabo būlī hene aho babona ka lūgūlū nūūlū ntī gwa madūūtū mingī, būyūfunya shakwinha shabo sha kūnipelanya, na shitambò sha ng'waso gwawiza, na sha kūng'wiwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nakababūūja: A mapandī ga higūlya geneya mukikalaga ng'ūja koi, ni ga kinehe? (Kūshisha lelo gakitanagwa Bama, makūlū gaho ū mu Shihebulania ipandī lya higūlya).",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Nsango na kūshoshiwa būpya",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alilūūlū bawīlage a ba numba ya Isilseli gīkī, “Ū Seeba MULUNGU alīhaya, A bing'we mukwikala ng'wisosohaja ūmo bīītīlaga basīng'we, na kūgikūmvwa a mashigīmbo gabo ga malofu? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūlū ng'wabafunya shakwinha a baana bing'we, gīkī babize shitambò sha kūpemvwa mu moto, kūshisha lelo īyī mukwisosohajaga kūlwa mashiikolile ging'we ga kūlamiwa pye a gose. Nikale nūmuzunīlīja kūnibūūja bing'we ba numba ya Isilaeli? Ūmo nene nalī mpanga; alīhaya Seeba MULUNGU, natūmuzunīlīja kūnibūūja mhayo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mūkūhayaga, “Tūtogilwe kūbiza gītī mahanga gangī, gītī banhū ba mu sī, abo bakalamyaga mitī na mawe.” Gwike ūyo mukūgwiganikaga gūtilonga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno ūmo nene nalī mpanga, alīhaya Seeba MULUNGU, nakūmusuga na nkono gwane gwa būdūla, nakūgūgoloola mu būpelanu būtaale. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nakūng'wenha kūfuma kū mahanga ga banhū, nakūgoloola nkono gwane gwa būdūla mu būpelanu būtaale, namubilinge kūfuma ū kū mahanga ga banhū, kūfuma ū kū sī ījo ng'wasambaagījiwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nakūmutwala kwitogolo lya mahanga, nakamanhye ning'we būshū kū būshū kwenūko nang'winhe nsango. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūmo nakabinhīla nsango basīng'we kwitogolo lya Misili, na a bing'we nakūng'winha nsango gīko; alīhaya Seeba MULUNGU. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nakūmusuga nene ng'wenekīlī na nang'ha gwane, nang'wingīje mu būsangī wa būlagane. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nakūmsūngūla nabīnje mo a bagomi na a bashitiigwa; a benabo nūūlū īkī nakūbīnja ū mu sī ījo biikalaga, alīyo nahene batingīla ū mu sī ya Isilaeli. Hūna mukūdeeba gīkī ūnene nalī SEEBA.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.38"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna lūūlū a bing'we numba ya Isilaeli, ū Seeba MULUNGU alīhaya gīkī, Jagi; būlī ūmò wing'we akagatūmamīle a mashiikolile ging'we ga kūlamiwa! Alīyo a hanuma ya henaho mukūnidegeleka ng'oye ū kūlīsosohaja ī lina lyane lyeela mu nzīla ya kūnifunīja shakwinha shing'we na mashiikolile ging'we ga kūlamiwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno ū kū sī yenīyo, ū kū lūgūlū lwa Isilaeli, ū lūgūlū lwane lwela, ī numba ya Isilaeli īkūnitūmamīla pyī ī yose; alīhaya Seeba MULUNGU, nū nene nakūbanukūla ū kwenūko. Nī shakwinha shin'gwe nakūshikoobela kwipandī lyenīlo, na a manong'ho a gawiza nī shitambò shing'we ī sheela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nīyo ūlū nūng'wīnja ū kū mahanga, nūmubilinga kūfuma ū kū sī ījo musambaalīlile, nakūng'wanukūla mubize gītī shakwinha sha ng'waso gwawiza; hūna nakwiyoolecha nalī ng'wela ū mu bing'we, na a mahanga gakūbona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūlū nūmushisha ū mu sī ya Isilaeli, ī sī īyo nakagoloola nkono nūbilahīlīla bakūlūgenji bing'we gīkī nakūbinha, a henaho mukūdeeba gīkī ū nene nalī SEEBA; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nī nhūngwa jing'we mukūjiizūkwa, pyī nī shītwa shing'we īsho shang'wenheleja kūsosohala, mukwidalaha no kūlwa būbi bose ūbo ng'wawīta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bing'we numba ya Isilaeli, ū Seeba MULUNGU alīhaya gīkī, ūlū nūng'wītīla ī yenīyo kūlwa lina lyane, ītī kūlenganīla na nzīla jing'we ī jabūbi na shītīle shing'we sha malofu, mukūdeeba gīkī ū nene nalī SEEBA.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.44"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Būhangi kūlwa sī ya dakama",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mhayo go ng'wa Seeba gūnizīīla, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ng'wana wa munhū, galūkaga; ū būshū wako būlole dakama, ūlīlomeele ī lipandī lya dakama ūlīhūgūle; ī lipoolu lya sī ya dakama ūlīhangīle. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.46"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Līwīlage ī lipoolu lya dakama gīkī, ‘Gwigwage ū mhayo go ng'wa Seeba. Ū Seeba MULUNGU alīhaya gīkī, Nalī hihī kūkūpemba moto ū bebe, gwīnegeteje pyī ī mitī yako, ī midoto nī myūmu. Ū moto gwa būpī wene gūtī gwa kūjimiwa kwīngīīla dakama kūja sukuma, nīyo gūkūūmabūla būlī ng'wene ū kū būshū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.47"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "48",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:48"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "48",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pye a banhū bakūbona gīkī nene Seeba hū naagūbakije; gūtūbiza gwa kūjimiwa.’” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.48",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.48"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "49",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:49"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "49",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A henaho nūhaya, “Ee Seeba MULUNGU! Ūlū balīnihaya bakwiwīlaga gīkī, ‘Ū ng'wenūyū atūhayaga sumo dūhū a hene?’”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.49",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.49"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
